<title>USA: Dow Jones average gains more than 100 points.</title>
<headline>Dow Jones average gains more than 100 points.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Dow Jones industrial average gained more than 100 points on Tuesday, building on an early rally that was fueled by favorable numbers on the economy.</p>
<p>At 11:33 a.m. EDT, the Dow was up 100.75 points at 6,883.77.</p>
